# hsc tests
# NOTE the explicit -O3: hsc's codec path is floating point and duck's default -Ofast implies
# -ffast-math, which can perturb the stream-defining trig
# Comptime stress (raised constexpr limits): scripts/ctbuild
# prefer building freestanding for the github release in case people don't have glibc or other install shenanigans
test tests/ -O3 -i include/micron/tests -i include/micron -i include/micron/src -i /usr/include -ke --start include/micron/start
# Sanitizer
# debug tests/fuzz_unhopf.cpp --asan --ubsan -O3 -i include/micron/tests -i include/micron -i include/micron/src -i /usr/include
